rg/zh/cultivation/%E5%A4%A7s-%E5%A8%B1%E4%B9%90%E5%9C%88%E7%9A%84%E9%82%A3%E4%BA%9B%E4%BA%8B/</guid><description>01、掌声是他人给的 特殊加持与改变 S，让人想起了花。鲜花需要绿叶，更需要阳光、水、养分。今天刚好也跟几位娱乐圈的朋友聊起，借此顺便说几句。 早</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%a4%a7S%20%e5%a8%b1%e4%b9%90%e5%9c%88%e7%9a%84%e9%82%a3%e4%ba%9b%e4%ba%8b.assets/640-1739060196755-71.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>2025送给大家一份最大的礼物</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/2025%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99%E5%A4%A7%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%BD%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E7%89%A9/</link><pubDate>Sun, 02 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 02 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/2025%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99%E5%A4%A7%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%BD%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E7%89%A9/</guid><description>这篇本来不打算发的。昨天看新闻，有三位华裔小朋友死于前天的空难。 于心不忍，还是写下这篇给有缘的朋友们。尽管这些年“说”了太多，为此有因必有果</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/2025%e9%80%81%e7%bb%99%e5%a4%a7%e5%ae%b6%e4%b8%80%e4%bb%bd%e6%9c%80%e5%a4%a7%e7%9a%84%e7%a4%bc%e7%89%a9.assets/640-1739058006867-15.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>迎财神小妙招！</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E8%BF%8E%E8%B4%A2%E7%A5%9E%E5%B0%8F%E5%A6%99%E6%8B%9B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 31 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E8%BF%8E%E8%B4%A2%E7%A5%9E%E5%B0%8F%E5%A6%99%E6%8B%9B/</guid><description>我知道大家都喜欢多些财运， 这个世间没钱万万不行。 很多人找财但没财， 大家想想为什么？ 因为人找财难。 今天我教大家一个方法， 可以让财来找你。 大家有</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%bf%8e%e8%b4%a2%e7%a5%9e%e5%b0%8f%e5%a6%99%e6%8b%9b.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>新年寄语</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E6%96%B0%E5%B9%B4%E5%AF%84%E8%AF%AD/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E6%96%B0%E5%B9%B4%E5%AF%84%E8%AF%AD/</guid><description/><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%96%b0%e5%b9%b4%e5%af%84%e8%af%ad.assets/640.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>归途</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%BD%92%E9%80%94/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%BD%92%E9%80%94/</guid><description>—— 琼瑶 这是琼瑶先生离世前写的一段话，相信很多人都已经看过了。 作为一名医务工作人员，我能深深体会那份感受。所以我早年的生活尽量洒脱，想做什么</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%bd%92%e9%80%94.assets/640.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>《黄帝内经》研修基础班招生</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/news/%E9%BB%84%E5%B8%9D%E5%86%85%E7%BB%8F%E7%A0%94%E4%BF%AE%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E7%8F%AD%E6%8B%9B%E7%94%9F/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Mon, 02 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/news/%E9%BB%84%E5%B8%9D%E5%86%85%E7%BB%8F%E7%A0%94%E4%BF%AE%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E7%8F%AD%E6%8B%9B%E7%94%9F/</guid><description>《黄帝内经》由公元前二千七百多年前流传至今，已有近5000年历史。该书是最早的一本中医古籍，分《素问》《灵枢》，一共一百六十二篇。 《素问》主</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e9%bb%84%e5%b8%9d%e5%86%85%e7%bb%8f%e7%a0%94%e4%bf%ae%e5%9f%ba%e7%a1%80%e7%8f%ad%e6%8b%9b%e7%94%9f.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>新闻 News</category></item><item><title>一命二运三风水…… 九交贵人十？？？</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E4%B8%80%E5%91%BD%E4%BA%8C%E8%BF%90%E4%B8%89%E9%A3%8E%E6%B0%B4-%E4%B9%9D%E4%BA%A4%E8%B4%B5%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%81/</link><pubDate>Sat, 31 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 31 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E4%B8%80%E5%91%BD%E4%BA%8C%E8%BF%90%E4%B8%89%E9%A3%8E%E6%B0%B4-%E4%B9%9D%E4%BA%A4%E8%B4%B5%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%81/</guid><description>现代人，越来越多的喜欢上了风水。 风水可以改变运气，从而变相改变人生，故有“一命二运三风水”之说，但很少人知道后面的话。 也正因为很少人知道，故</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e4%b8%80%e5%91%bd%e4%ba%8c%e8%bf%90%e4%b8%89%e9%a3%8e%e6%b0%b4%20%e4%b9%9d%e4%ba%a4%e8%b4%b5%e4%ba%ba%e5%8d%81.assets/640.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>夏日小记 | 一场际遇</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%B0%8F%E8%AE%B0-%E4%B8%80%E5%9C%BA%E9%99%85%E9%81%87/</link><pubDate>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%B0%8F%E8%AE%B0-%E4%B8%80%E5%9C%BA%E9%99%85%E9%81%87/</guid><description>01 一切都过去了 大家都知道杨医生爱喝茶。多伦多的道友也都知道，杨医生每次泡茶用的水都是开车去郊外打的山泉水&amp;hellip;今日有幸和杨医生一起</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%a4%8f%e6%97%a5%e5%b0%8f%e8%ae%b0%20%e4%b8%80%e5%9c%ba%e9%99%85%e9%81%87.assets/640-1721835588333-49.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>如是当下</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A6%82%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%B8%8B/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A6%82%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%B8%8B/</guid><description>国外呆了很多年，我这个人特别懒得动。2019年也不知道哪根筋搭错了，屁颠屁颠地跑回中国，而且这一跑不得了。 从上海到成都然后藏地，又浙江 - 衢州</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%a6%82%e6%98%af%e5%bd%93%e4%b8%8b.assets/image-20240317112410137.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item></channel></rss>